  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong><br>Wakokoro Tea is a Japanese tea brand that brings authentic, high-quality matcha and Japanese tea to customers around the world. We work directly with tea farmers and tea producers in Japan to source carefully selected matcha from renowned tea regions such as Uji, Yame, and Kagoshima. Our products include ceremonial-grade matcha, latte-grade matcha, hojicha powder, and premium loose-leaf teas for both everyday enjoyment and professional use.</p><p><strong>• What makes us different:</strong><br>We focus on quality, transparency, and authentic Japanese tea culture. By working closely with trusted tea producers, we are able to offer fresh matcha with vibrant color, rich umami, and excellent balance. Our goal is not only to sell tea, but also to share the story, tradition, and craftsmanship behind Japanese tea with customers worldwide.</p><p><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn commission by promoting Wakokoro Tea products through their unique affiliate links. When customers purchase through your link, you receive a percentage of the sale. The more traffic and conversions you generate, the more you can earn.</p><p><strong>• How to promote us:</strong><br>Affiliates can promote Wakokoro Tea through social media (Instagram, TikTok, YouTube), blogs, newsletters, and websites. Creating matcha recipes, latte tutorials, reviews, or lifestyle content featuring matcha works especially well and resonates with audiences interested in wellness, Japanese culture, and specialty beverages.</p><p><strong>• Other information:</strong><br>We are happy to support affiliates with product information, media assets, and occasionally product samples for content creation. Our mission is to build long-term partnerships with creators who share our passion for high-quality Japanese tea.</p></div></div>",
